    </li>\n                  <li class=\"uq-header__nav-secondary-item\" data-gtm-category=\"Secondary header\">\n            <a href=\"https://contacts.uq.edu.au/contacts\" class=\"uq-header__nav-secondary-link\"\n               data-gtm-label=\"Contact\">Contact</a>\n          </li>\n              </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n    <div class=\"uq-alerts-global-container\" data-uri=\"https://www.uq.edu.au/api/v1/alerts.json\"></div>\n                                  <main id=\"uq-main\">\n                \n<div id=\"block-uq-standard-theme-breadcrumbs\" class=\"block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block\">\n  \n    \n\n        <div class=\"uq-breadcrumbs\">\n    <div class=\"uq-container\">\n      \n<nav class=\"uq-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" data-gtm-category=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"uq-breadcrumb__list\">\n              <li class=\"uq-breadcrumb__item\">\n                          <a class=\"uq-breadcrumb__link\" title=\"UQ home\" data-gtm-label=\"UQ home\" href=\"https://uq.edu.au/\">UQ home</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"uq-breadcrumb__item\">\n                          <a class=\"uq-breadcrumb__link\" title=\"Scholarships\" data-gtm-label=\"UQ home > Scholarships\" href=\"/\">Scholarships</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"uq-breadcrumb__item\">\n                          <a class=\"uq-breadcrumb__link\" title=\"Support and resources\" data-gtm-label=\"UQ home &gt; Scholarships > Support and resources\" href=\"/resources\">Support and resources</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"uq-breadcrumb__item\">\n                          <a class=\"uq-breadcrumb__link\" title=\"Scholarships for PhD and MPhil students\" data-gtm-label=\"UQ home &gt; Scholarships &gt; Support and resources > Scholarships for PhD and MPhil students\" href=\"/phd-mphil-students\">Scholarships for PhD and MPhil students</a>\n              </li>\n            </ol>\n</nav>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n                    <div class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section__content\">\n              \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                    <div class=\"section section--no-spacing\">\n          <div class=\"section__content\">\n              <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                    <div class=\"section section--no-spacing\">\n          <div class=\"section__content\">\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n              \n<div id=\"block-uq-standard-theme-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n\n      <article about=\"/phd-mphil-students\">\n  \n    \n  <div>\n    <div class=\"uq-hero   \" data-gtm-category=\"Hero banner\">\n    <div class=\"uq-container\">\n    <div class=\"uq-hero__content\">\n      <h1 class=\"uq-hero__title\">Scholarships for PhD and MPhil students</h1>\n                </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uq-container\">\n  <div class=\"uq-sidebar-layout\">\n    <div class=\"uq-sidebar-layout__sidebar\">\n      <div id=\"local-nav-app\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"uq-sidebar-layout__main\">\n      <div class=\"uq-section \">\n          <p class=\"text--l\">Understand the types of scholarships and funding available to support your Doctor of Philosophy (PhD), Master of Philosophy (MPhil) or professional doctorate.</p><h2>Follow your passion for research</h2><p>Scholarships give you the financial freedom to focus on your research and get the most out of your studies. We offer a range of scholarships to support your needs. Check if you\u2019re eligible and apply on time.&nbsp;</p><p><a class=\"button button--primary\" href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level[101]=101\">Browse scholarships</a></p><h2>Funding types for postgraduate research (HDR) scholarships</h2><p>There\u2019s more than one way to be supported during your research. You<strong> can apply for multiple scholarships</strong> based on different funding types to support aspects of your research and experience.</p><h3>Living stipend</h3><p>The major scholarships are&nbsp;living stipends. These offer $39.2K a year tax free (2026 rate) in fortnightly payments&nbsp;to help&nbsp;cover your living costs.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level%5B101%5D=101&amp;funding_type%5B2%5D=2\">Browse all living stipend scholarships</a></p><h3>Tuition fees</h3><p>Tuition fees cover the cost of your tuition for the duration of your studies.</p><p>If you\u2019re a <strong>domestic student,</strong> you can apply anytime without needing a living stipend scholarship.</p><p>If you\u2019re an <strong>international student,</strong> you'll need a living stipend scholarship to be eligible for a tuition scholarship.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level[101]=101&amp;funding_type[5]=5\">Browse tuition fee scholarships</a></p><h3>Top-ups</h3><p>If you're on a living stipend scholarship, you could be eligible for a top-up scholarship&nbsp;to further help with the cost of living.</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level[101]=101&amp;funding_type[3]=3\">Browse all top up scholarships</a></p><h3>Financial award</h3><p>Grants and bursaries are usually given as a one-off award,&nbsp;and you can usually only receive 1 per academic year.&nbsp;You could receive funds to&nbsp;support extra-curricular activities, so it's&nbsp;worth taking the time to find out what you could apply for.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level[101]=101&amp;funding_type[1]=1\">Browse all financial award scholarships</a></p><h3>Travel</h3><p>If you're going on a trip as part of your studies, we have&nbsp;scholarships that provide a travel allowance&nbsp;to cover your travel costs.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level[101]=101&amp;funding_type[4]=4\">Browse&nbsp;all&nbsp;travel scholarships</a></p><h2>Major living stipend scholarships</h2><p>You<strong> may be eligible to receive a number of scholarships</strong> during your research, but you can only receive 1 base stipend scholarship. You apply for these scholarships as part of your program application.&nbsp;</p><p>Be sure to check the rules and requirements before you apply.&nbsp;</p><div class=\"uq-accordion uq-accordion--is-manual\" data-gtm-category=\"Accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Accordion button group\"><div class=\"uq-accordion__item\" role=\"presentation\"><button class=\"uq-accordion__toggle\" data-gtm-no-link aria-controls=\"accordion\" aria-expanded=\"false\" id=\"accordion-title\"><div>Graduate Research School Scholarships (UQGRSS)</div></button><div class=\"uq-accordion__content\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"accordion\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-title\"><p>A competitive scholarship available for all study areas.</p><p>These scholarships:</p><ul><li>are available for domestic and international students</li><li>fund tuition fees, living stipend of $39.2K a year tax free (2026&nbsp;rate), indexed yearly</li><li>include Single Overseas Student Health Cover (OSHC).</li></ul><p>Graduate Research School Scholarships are offered in rounds during the year. Make sure you are aware of the round deadlines, as they affect which research quarter you can commence in.</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarship/graduate-school-scholarships-uqgss-%E2%80%93-includes-rtp\">View Graduate Research School Scholarship</a></p></div></div><div class=\"uq-accordion__item\" role=\"presentation\"><button class=\"uq-accordion__toggle\" data-gtm-no-link aria-controls=\"accordion--2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" id=\"accordion--2-title\"><div>Fellowship support scheme scholarships</div></button><div class=\"uq-accordion__content\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"accordion--2\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion--2-title\"><p>A competitive scholarship available for specific projects linked to research grants.</p><p>These scholarships:</p><ul><li>are available for domestic students</li><li>\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bfund tuition fees, living stipend of $39.2K a year tax free (2026&nbsp;rate), indexed yearly.</li></ul><p>Projects linked to fellowship scholarships are advertised as they become available. Once an applicant is successful, the project is closed.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/scholarship/fellowship-support-scheme-scholarships\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"5e69bcd7-817b-4eec-968f-92c6c090d948\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">View Fellowship support scheme scholarships</a></p></div></div><div class=\"uq-accordion__item\" role=\"presentation\"><button class=\"uq-accordion__toggle\" data-gtm-no-link aria-controls=\"accordion--3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" id=\"accordion--3-title\"><div>Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Research Scholarships</div></button><div class=\"uq-accordion__content\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"accordion--3\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion--3-title\"><p>A competitive scholarship available for all study areas to support Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples.</p><p>These scholarships:</p><ul><li>are available for Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait islander students</li><li>fund tuition fees and a living stipend of $49.2K a year (2026&nbsp;rate), indexed yearly.</li></ul><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarship/aboriginal-and-torres-strait-islander-research-scholarships\">View Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Research Scholarship</a></p></div></div></div><h2>Other postgraduate scholarships</h2><p>We also offer scholarships that are funded by external organisations, UQ faculties, centres, institutes, and donors. These scholarships often align with a particular field of research or purpose.</p><p>Eligibility and funding types vary for the scholarships available.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://scholarships.uq.edu.au/scholarships?level[101]=101&amp;funding_type[2]=2&amp;funding_type[5]=5\">Explore all tuition and living stipend scholarships</a></p><h3>Tuition only scholarship</h3><h4>Graduate Research School Scholarship \u2013 Tuition (UQGRSS-T)</h4><p>Available for domestic students only, this is a tuition-based research scholarship available for all study areas. This does <strong>not</strong> include a living stipend. You apply for this as part of your program application.</p><p><a href=\"/scholarship/uq-graduate-school-scholarship-tuition-uqgss-t\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"c3a66d53-9fe4-46c1-9fd3-2caddfd568ef\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">View Graduate School Scholarship \u2013 Tuition</a></p><h2>Contact&nbsp;</h2><p>If you have questions, the Graduate Research School can help.</p><p>Email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:graduateresearchschool@uq.edu.au\">graduateresearchschool@uq.edu.au</a>&nbsp;<br>Phone:&nbsp;<a href=\"tel::07 3346 0503\">07 3346 0503</a></p>\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n      \n      \n    </main>\n  \n      \n    \n<footer id=\"uq-footer\" class=\"uq-footer\" data-gtm-category=\"Footer\">\n  <div class=\"uq-acknowledgement uq-acknowledgement--large\">\n    <div class=\"uq-acknowledgement__content\">\n      <div class=\"uq-acknowledgement__text\">\n        UQ acknowledges the Traditional Owners and their custodianship of the lands on which UQ is situated. <a href=\"https://about.uq.edu.au/strategy-values/reconciliation\" class=\"uq-acknowledgement__link\">Reconciliation at UQ</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"uq-footer__container\">\n    <nav class=\"uq-footer__navigation uq-footer--desktop\" aria-label=\"footer navigation\">\n      <ul class=\"uq-footer__navigation-list uq-footer__navigation-level-1\">\n                  <li class=\"uq-footer__navigation-item\">\n            <h2 class=\"uq-footer__navigation-title\">Media</h2>\n            <ul class=\"uq-footer__navigation-list uq-footer__navigation-level-2\">\n                 